@host = http://localhost:5240
@userId = 66666666-6666-6666-6666-666666666666
@invoiceId = a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111

### Sve fakture
GET {{host}}/api/invoice

### Fakture jednog projekta
GET {{host}}/api/invoice?projectId=044f3de0-a9dd-4c2e-b745-89976a1b2a36

### Jedna faktura
GET {{host}}/api/invoice/{{invoiceId}}

### Stavke fakture
GET {{host}}/api/invoice/{{invoiceId}}/items

### Nova faktura sa dve stavke
POST {{host}}/api/invoice
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "projectId": "044f3de0-a9dd-4c2e-b745-89976a1b2a36",
  "issueDate": "2026-08-19T00:00:00",
  "items": [
    { "description": "Konsultacije", "unitPrice": 80.00, "quantity": 5 },
    { "description": "Testiranje", "unitPrice": 60.00, "quantity": 8 }
  ]
}

### Dodavanje stavke na postojecu fakturu
POST {{host}}/api/invoice/{{invoiceId}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Dodatna obuka",
  "unitPrice": 120.00,
  "quantity": 2
}

### Uplata veca od duga - ocekuje se 409
POST {{host}}/api/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "amount": 99999
}

### Uplata koja izmiruje fakturu - ocekuje se 201
POST {{host}}/api/payment
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

{
  "invoiceId": "{{invoiceId}}",
  "amount": 1500
}

### Izmena placene fakture - ocekuje se 409
PUT {{host}}/api/invoice/{{invoiceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Cancelled"
}

### Sve uplate
GET {{host}}/api/payment
